  "description": "<p>When upgrading from 4. to 6 in two steps - ie F4-&gt;F5 and then F5-&gt;F6 you'll see the following error in the second step (F5-&gt;F6):</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>```<br/>\nERROR 11:13:54.063 (MigrateResourceTask) Failed to process ResourceInfo{parentId='info:fedora', fullId='info:fedora/container1', nameEncoded='container1', outerDirectory=/Users/danielbernstein/tmp/fcrepo-4.7.5-to-5.1.1-upgrade/rest, innerDirectory=/Users/danielbernstein/tmp/fcrepo-4.7.5-to-5.1.1-upgrade/rest/container1, type=CONTAINER}<br/>\njava.lang.IllegalStateException: Failed to identify interaction model for resource info:fedora/container1<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.upgrade.utils.f6.ResourceMigrator.identifyInteractionModel(ResourceMigrator.java:423)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.upgrade.utils.f6.ResourceMigrator.migrateContainerVersion(ResourceMigrator.java:175)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.upgrade.utils.f6.ResourceMigrator.migrateContainer(ResourceMigrator.java:165)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.upgrade.utils.f6.ResourceMigrator.migrate(ResourceMigrator.java:124)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.upgrade.utils.f6.MigrateResourceTask.run(MigrateResourceTask.java:59)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.upgrade.utils.f6.MigrationTaskManager.lambda$submit$0(MigrationTaskManager.java:66)<br/>\n\tat java.base/java.util.concurrent.Executors$RunnableAdapter.call(Executors.java:515)<br/>\n\tat java.base/java.util.concurrent.FutureTask.run(FutureTask.java:264)<br/>\n\tat java.base/java.util.concurrent.ThreadPoolExecutor.runWorker(ThreadPoolExecutor.java:1128)<br/>\n\tat java.base/java.util.concurrent.ThreadPoolExecutor$Worker.run(ThreadPoolExecutor.java:628)<br/>\n\tat java.base/java.lang.Thread.run(Thread.java:834)<br/>\n```</p>",
